 <!--- 1/23/05 --->
            <tr vAlign="top">
              <td class="bigyellow" width="810" colSpan="2">January 22, 2005 -
                The House Rebuilds.. <br>
                <img src="images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
            <tr>
              <td width="251"><img alt src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/ahr1.jpg" border="0" width="235" height="273">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
              </td>
              <td width="553" valign="top" align="left">
                <p align="left">Over the past month we've seen our average
                online numbers jump to more than triple what they were in
                November!&nbsp; With quality recruits joining us weekly, and a
                drive to fulfill our goals binding us, success WILL be
                ours!&nbsp; In less than one month we've keyed and sharded over
                15 new members, killed Emp TWICE, took the initiative to gain
                alternate access to Solsek Ro's tower, and won an epic 1.5's (
                gratz Raccoo).&nbsp; Congratulations on your hard work
                HA!&nbsp;&nbsp; Where is HA going next?&nbsp; Join us and find
                out!&nbsp; Contact Ilainya, Guildor, Araon, Tsunan, Arxael,
                Sehnea, Xaleban or Ouruk soon! </p>
                <p align="left"><font color="#ffff00">- Guildor</font></p>
                <p align="left"><br>
                <img border="0" src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/ahr3.jpg" width="450" height="353"></p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr vAlign="top">
              <td class="bigyellow" width="810" colSpan="2"></td>
            <tr vAlign="top">
              <td class="bigyellow" width="810" colSpan="2">January 19, 2005 -
                Emporer Dies... 2x in 1 week... Cursed 2x in 24 hours...<br>
                <img src="images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
            <tr>
              <td width="251" valign="top" align="left">We've set our goals
                quickly and we are accomplishing them.&nbsp; Gratz on Emp x 2..
                looking forward to kills 10, 11, 12....&nbsp; Oh and BTW.. gratz
                Cavall.&nbsp; Your new threads are stylin'!
                <p><font color="#ffff00">- Guildor</font></p>
                &nbsp;&nbsp; </td>
              <td width="553" valign="top" align="left">&nbsp;<img border="0" src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/emp1.jpg" align="top" width="400" height="238"></td>
            </tr>

<!--- 10/13/04 --->			
			<tr valign="top">
				<td width="760" colspan="2" class="bigyellow">December 13th, 2004 - A New Era Begins...<br><img src="images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
			<tr valign="top">
			<td width="150"><img src="images/Xegony/Xegony.jpg" width="150" height="150" border="0" alt=""></td>
				<td>  

The recent release of EQ2, WoW and the slow retirement of many longtime
 EQ players has changed the face of EQ more in the past 2 months than in any time in its 
 history. House Archon was on the verge of breaking into the Plane of Time when this tragedy
  struck - scattering our members across the virtual realms and snatching certain victory
   from our grasp. What is done is done however - it is time to move on - to rebuild.<br><br>
   
House Archon has a long distinguished history on the Torv server as a guild of 
skilled, competent and friendly people. A solid core of these players remain
 - faithful, strong, and dedicated. It is time to step out of the shadow of 
 recent events and bring these qualities to the forefront again. It is time to 
 begin a new era for House Archon that will see us move into PoTime and beyond! 
 Do you wish to participate? Our doors our open! Welcome to our new home.<br><br>

<font color="#FFFF00">- Guildor, Arxael, Tsunan, Masterfyst, Araon, Muislo</font> <br><br><br>

			</td>
			</tr>
	
